        "created_at": "2021-04-15T12:40:38.544Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Dug into it a little, and it looks like there is! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> If you go to the “Unread” view, there’s a <strong>Dismiss</strong> button at the bottom. If you hit that and do <em>not</em> check the box, it will just clear the unread items. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/+1/2.png?v=9\" title=\":+1:t2:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":+1:t2:\"> Hopefully that’s what you were looking for? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=9\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"></p>",
